<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Gravelgut</defName>
    <label>gravelgut</label>
    <description>A low armored slab that eats the ground itself — gravel, glass-crumb, mineral crust — and passes it as smooth sorted pebbles the locals kick apart to read what is buried underneath. Mouthparts worn to polished stone, hide set with a mosaic of swallowed-and-rejected glass. It ignores everything and hits like a wall if pressed.</description>
